{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":13,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Thus said Jehovah to me, Go and buy yourself a linen girdle, and put it on your loins, but do not put it in water.","tok":[{"t":"Thus said "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to me, "},{"t":"Go","s":["H1980"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and buy yourself a "},{"t":"linen","s":["H6593"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"put","s":["H7760"],"a":[9]},{"t":" it on your "},{"t":"loins","s":["H4975"],"a":[11]},{"t":", but do not "},{"t":"put","s":["H0935"],"a":[14]},{"t":" it in "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"So I bought a girdle according to the word of Jehovah and put it upon my loins.","tok":[{"t":"So I bought a "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[2]},{"t":" according to the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"put","s":["H7760"],"a":[5]},{"t":" it upon my "},{"t":"loins","s":["H4975"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And the word of Jehovah came to me a second time, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to me a second "},{"t":"time","s":["H8145"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":4,"text":"Take the girdle which you bought, which is upon your loins, and rise up; go to the Euphrates, and hide it there in a cleft of the rock.","tok":[{"t":"Take","s":["H3947"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[2]},{"t":" which you bought, which is upon your "},{"t":"loins","s":["H4975"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and rise up; "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[10]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"hide","s":["H2934"],"a":[11]},{"t":" it there in a cleft of the "},{"t":"rock","s":["H5553"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And I went and I hid it by the Euphrates, as Jehovah had commanded me.","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" and I "},{"t":"hid","s":["H2934"],"a":[1]},{"t":" it by the "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[2]},{"t":", as "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" had "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H6680"],"a":[4]},{"t":" me."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And at the end of many days Jehovah said to me, Rise up; go to the Euphrates, and take from there the girdle which I commanded you to hide there.","tok":[{"t":"And at the "},{"t":"end","s":["H7093"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to me, Rise up; "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[9]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"take","s":["H3947"],"a":[10]},{"t":" from there the "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[13]},{"t":" which I "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H6680"],"a":[15]},{"t":" you to "},{"t":"hide","s":["H2934"],"a":[16]},{"t":" there."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And I went to the Euphrates and dug, and I took the girdle from the place where I had hidden it; and there the girdle was, spoiled and good for nothing.","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"Euphrates","s":["H6578"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and dug, and I "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[5]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[7]},{"t":" where I had hidden it; and there the "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[13]},{"t":" was, spoiled and good for nothing."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the word of Jehovah came to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":","}]},{"n":9,"text":"Thus says Jehovah, Even so I will destroy the pride of Judah and the great pride of Jerusalem.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Even so I will destroy the "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"This evil people, who refuse to hear My words, who walk in the stubbornness of their heart and go after other gods to serve them and to worship them, will be even like this girdle, which is good for nothing.","tok":[{"t":"This "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[0]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"refuse","s":["H3987"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[4]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[6]},{"t":", who "},{"t":"walk","s":["H1980"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in the stubbornness of their "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"after","s":["H0310"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"other","s":["H0312"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[12]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"serve","s":["H5647"],"a":[14]},{"t":" them and to "},{"t":"worship","s":["H7812"],"a":[15]},{"t":" them, will be even like this "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[18]},{"t":", which is "},{"t":"good","s":["H6743"],"a":[22]},{"t":" for nothing."}]},{"n":11,"text":"For as this girdle clings to the loins of a man, so I have caused all the house of Israel and all the house of Judah to cling to Me, declares Jehovah, that they might be to Me a people and a name and a praise and a glory; but they would not listen.","tok":[{"t":"For as this "},{"t":"girdle","s":["H0232"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"clings","s":["H1692"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"loins","s":["H4975"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[6]},{"t":", so I have caused all the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[13]},{"t"